{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.third",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "真乃 · 相遇 · third",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.third",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.third",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "事务所的灯只开了半排。她把包放在桌上，站得笔直，像在等谁先开口。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "抱歉，这么晚还来打扰……",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我一直在想一件事。我这样的人，真的可以站到台上去吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "n04"
      },
      "n04": {
        "id": "n04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "不是不想。是怕上去以后，让别人失望。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "那就先站一次小的",
            "nextNodeId": "n05a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "失望也是我们自己的事",
            "nextNodeId": "n05b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "你已经在准备了，我看得见",
            "nextNodeId": "n05c",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n05a": {
        "id": "n05a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "小的……像那种只有几十个人的场子吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05b": {
        "id": "n05b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我们……您说\"我们\"。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05c": {
        "id": "n05c",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "被看见了。有点不好意思，但也有点高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "那……我可以试试吗。哪怕只有一次。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "text": "她说这句话的时候没有低头。窗外有鸽子落在窗台上，停了一下又飞走。"
      }
    }
  },
